     1477       field cost-income-rubl              as decimal
     1478       field cost-income-base              as decimal
     1479       field sum-cost-income-rubl          as decimal
     1480       field sum-cost-income-base          as decimal
     1481       field sum-vat-cost-income-rubl      as decimal
     1482       field sum-vat-cost-income-base      as decimal
     1483       field vat-cost-income-rubl          as decimal
     1484       field vat-cost-income-base          as decimal
